 "$comment": "TempleOS Mobile UI locales. Adapted on 2026-10-16 from an earlier locale set by the same author: 89 canonical locales over 73 translation catalogs. TempleOS Mobile reads only this copy at runtime. Country candidates are used only with the device's own region subtag (never geography). See docs/localization.md.",
 "app_name": "TempleOS.app",
 "$app_name": "The apps' name (README, Names): the iOS/Android label written by tools/l10n/gen_platform.py, and {app} in every catalog. A proper name: never translated. Brand.APP_NAME (Kotlin) and Brand.appName (Swift) must equal it. TempleOS alone always means Terry A. Davis' operating system.",
